{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "breadcrumb",
    "version": "2.1.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "interactive",
      "navigation",
      "wayfinding"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/breadcrumb-docs"
    },
    "layer": "molecule",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/06-molecules/_breadcrumb.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/molecules/breadcrumb.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/breadcrumb-docs.html"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "2.1.0",
        "changes": [
          "07.10.2026 (Plan v3, Phase 5): Slot section (.nc-breadcrumb-section, --above/--below) — die Huelle, in der die Website den Breadcrumb ueber oder unter dem Seitenkopf rendert (page.html.twig)."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-breadcrumb"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "list",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__list",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "item",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__item",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "link",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__link",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "page",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__page",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "separator",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__separator",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "home-icon",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__home-icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "back-icon",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__back-icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "ellipsis",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__ellipsis",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "ellipsis-wrap",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__ellipsis-wrap",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "dropdown",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__dropdown",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "dropdown-item",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb__dropdown-item",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "section",
        "element": ".nc-breadcrumb-section",
        "optional": true,
        "description": "Huelle um den Breadcrumb (<nav aria-label> mit .nc-container); --above mit Linie unten, --below mit Linie oben. Steht AUSSEN."
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Wrapper ist <nav class='nc-breadcrumb' aria-label='Breadcrumb'>.",
      "Liste ist <ol class='nc-breadcrumb__list'> — geordnete Semantik fuer den Pfad.",
      "Items sind <li class='nc-breadcrumb__item'> mit <a class='nc-breadcrumb__link'> oder <span class='nc-breadcrumb__page'>.",
      "Letztes Item: <span class='nc-breadcrumb__page' aria-current='page'> — nicht klickbar, font-weight medium.",
      "Breadcrumb-Labels muessen exakt mit den <h1>-Ueberschriften der Zielseiten uebereinstimmen (kognitive Konsistenz).",
      "Separator: <span class='nc-breadcrumb__separator' aria-hidden='true'> mit Chevron-SVG oder '/'.",
      "Separatoren haben reduzierte Opacity (40%) und feste min-width gegen Layout-Shift.",
      "Home-Icon: <span class='nc-breadcrumb__home-icon'> mit Haus-SVG ersetzt 'Home'-Text. Link braucht aria-label='Home'.",
      "Smart-Truncation: Home + letzte 2 Items immer sichtbar. Mittlere Ebenen → Ellipsis-Dropdown.",
      "Ellipsis: <button class='nc-breadcrumb__ellipsis' aria-label='Weitere Seiten anzeigen'> fuer abgekuerzte Pfade.",
      "Ellipsis-Wrap: <li class='nc-breadcrumb__ellipsis-wrap'> ist Position-Context fuer Dropdown.",
      "Dropdown: <ul class='nc-breadcrumb__dropdown' role='menu'> nutzt nc-dropdown-* Tokens (gleicher shadow/radius wie Navigation-Menu).",
      "Dropdown-Item: <a class='nc-breadcrumb__dropdown-item' role='menuitem'> — einzelner Link.",
      "Ghost: Links wirken wie normaler Text (text-tertiary), erst bei Hover interaktiv. Ideal fuer Artikel-Seiten.",
      "Back-Link: Mobile-First — nur '← Parent' Link. Spart Platz fuer Content auf schmalen Viewports.",
      "Back-Link braucht aria-label='Zurueck zu [Parent-Name]' fuer Screen-Reader-Kontext.",
      "Website: page.html.twig rendert <nav class=\"nc-breadcrumb-section nc-breadcrumb-section--above|below\"><div class=\"nc-container\">…</div></nav> je nach neo_breadcrumb_position."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "size": {
      "label": "Size",
      "description": "2 Groessenabstufungen — sm (Admin/Sidebar) / md (Standard, DEFAULT)",
      "values": {
        "sm": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb--sm",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "size-sm"
          ]
        },
        "md": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": []
        }
      }
    },
    "appearance": {
      "label": "Appearance",
      "description": "Visueller Stil — default (Link-Farbe + Hover-Underline), ghost (dezente Links wie Text, erst bei Hover interaktiv)",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "core-colors"
          ]
        },
        "ghost": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb--ghost",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "variant-ghost"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "variant": {
      "label": "Variant",
      "description": "Darstellung — full (alle Items sichtbar), truncated (Smart-Truncation mit Ellipsis-Dropdown), back-link (nur Parent-Link fuer Mobile)",
      "values": {
        "full": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-full"
        },
        "truncated": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "dropdown"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "ellipsis": true
          },
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-truncated"
        },
        "back-link": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb--back-link",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "back-link"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-back-link"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Home-Element — text ('Home' als Wort) oder home-icon (Haus-SVG, platzsparend + international)",
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-text-home"
        },
        "home-icon": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "home-icon"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "home-icon": true
          },
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-icon-home"
        }
      }
    },
    "separator": {
      "label": "Separator",
      "description": "Trennzeichen — chevron (SVG, Standard), slash ('/'), dot (Punkt), square (Quadrat), custom (via Token)",
      "values": {
        "chevron": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "separator"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-chevron"
        },
        "slash": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "separator"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-slash"
        },
        "dot": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb__separator--dot",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "separator"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-dot"
        },
        "square": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb__separator--square",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "separator"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-square"
        },
        "custom": {
          "modifier": "nc-breadcrumb__separator--custom",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "separator"
          ],
          "renderHint": "breadcrumb-custom"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "hover",
      "focus",
      "open"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "open",
      "focus",
      "hover",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "hover",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Hover auf Links: underline + Farbwechsel. Ghost: text-tertiary → text-primary. Nicht auf __page."
      },
      {
        "state": "focus",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Focus-Ring auf Links und Ellipsis-Button via :focus-visible."
      },
      {
        "state": "open",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "aria-expanded=true auf Ellipsis-Button, Dropdown (.is-open) sichtbar mit versteckten Ebenen."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard"
      ],
      "note": "<nav aria-label='Breadcrumb'> auf Wrapper. <ol> fuer geordnete Semantik. aria-current='page' auf aktuellem Item. Separatoren sind aria-hidden='true'. Labels muessen mit Seiten-Ueberschriften uebereinstimmen."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "truncated"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label",
          "aria-haspopup",
          "aria-expanded"
        ],
        "note": "Ellipsis-Button braucht aria-label='Weitere Seiten anzeigen', aria-haspopup='true', aria-expanded='true|false'."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "truncated"
            ]
          },
          "states": [
            "open"
          ]
        },
        "require": [
          "role-menu",
          "role-menuitem",
          "keyboard-navigation"
        ],
        "note": "Dropdown: role='menu', Items: role='menuitem'. Keyboard: ArrowDown/Up navigiert, Escape schliesst, Tab verlaesst."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "home-icon"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "note": "Home-Icon Link braucht aria-label='Home' da kein sichtbarer Text vorhanden."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "back-link"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "note": "Back-Link braucht aria-label='Zurueck zu [Parent-Name]' fuer Screen-Reader-Kontext."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "nav-landmark",
          "aria-label",
          "aria-current-page"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "<nav aria-label='Breadcrumb'>. Letztes Item braucht aria-current='page'."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "truncated"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Ellipsis-Button braucht aria-label."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "home-icon"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Home-Icon Link braucht aria-label='Home'."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "variant": [
              "back-link"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-label"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Back-Link braucht aria-label mit Parent-Name."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "label": {
        "maxChars": 40,
        "note": "Breadcrumb-Labels muessen exakt mit Seiten-Ueberschriften uebereinstimmen. Kurz halten."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-breadcrumb"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "core-geometry",
      "core-colors"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "core-geometry": {
        "label": "Geometry",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-gap",
          "nc-breadcrumb-font-size"
        ]
      },
      "core-colors": {
        "label": "Colors",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-color",
          "nc-breadcrumb-color-current",
          "nc-breadcrumb-color-hover"
        ]
      },
      "separator": {
        "label": "Separator",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-color",
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-opacity",
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-size",
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-min-width",
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-custom"
        ]
      },
      "size-sm": {
        "label": "Size SM",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-font-size-sm"
        ]
      },
      "variant-ghost": {
        "label": "Ghost Variant",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-ghost-color",
          "nc-breadcrumb-ghost-color-hover"
        ]
      },
      "back-link": {
        "label": "Back-Link",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-back-icon-size",
          "nc-breadcrumb-back-gap"
        ]
      },
      "home-icon": {
        "label": "Home Icon",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-separator-size"
        ]
      },
      "dropdown": {
        "label": "Dropdown",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-breadcrumb-dropdown-min-width"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.size.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.appearance.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.variant.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.content.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.separator.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "tokenDependencies": {
    "nc-breadcrumb-color": {
      "syncsWith": [
        "nc-link-color"
      ],
      "note": "Breadcrumb-Links sollten die globale Link-Farbe oder eine dezentere Variante nutzen."
    },
    "nc-breadcrumb-color-current": {
      "syncsWith": [
        "nc-text-primary"
      ],
      "note": "Die aktuelle Seite (aria-current='page') nutzt die kraeftigste Textfarbe des Systems."
    },
    "nc-breadcrumb-gap": {
      "syncsWith": [
        "nc-spacing-02"
      ],
      "note": "Kompakter Gap fuer zusammenhaengenden Pfad-Charakter."
    }
  },
  "keyboard": {
    "Enter": {
      "action": "toggle-menu",
      "note": "Auf dem Ellipsis-Knopf: oeffnet das Menue der ausgeblendeten Ebenen, Fokus auf den ersten Eintrag (bzw. schliesst es). Im Menue: folgt dem Link (nativ).",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Space": {
      "action": "toggle-menu",
      "note": "Auf dem Ellipsis-Knopf wie Enter.",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "ArrowDown": {
      "action": "focus-next-item",
      "note": "Auf dem Ellipsis-Knopf: oeffnet, erster Eintrag. Im Menue: naechster Eintrag (rundum).",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "ArrowUp": {
      "action": "focus-prev-item",
      "note": "Auf dem Ellipsis-Knopf: oeffnet, letzter Eintrag. Im Menue: vorheriger Eintrag (rundum).",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Home": {
      "action": "focus-first-item",
      "note": "Im Menue: erster Eintrag.",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "End": {
      "action": "focus-last-item",
      "note": "Im Menue: letzter Eintrag.",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Escape": {
      "action": "close",
      "note": "Schliesst das Menue, Fokus zurueck auf den Ellipsis-Knopf.",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab": {
      "action": "close",
      "note": "Schliesst das Menue, der Fokus geht normal weiter. Die Eintraege selbst sind nicht in der Tab-Folge (tabindex=-1).",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "events": {
    "breadcrumb-toggle": {
      "bubbles": true,
      "detail": {
        "open": "boolean"
      },
      "note": "Gefeuert beim Oeffnen und Schliessen des Ellipsis-Menues.",
      "onlyWhen": {
        "axes": {
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "default-full",
      "label": "Full Path — Chevron",
      "description": "Vollstaendiger Breadcrumb-Pfad mit Chevron-Separatoren",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "appearance": [
            "default"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "full"
          ],
          "content": [
            "text"
          ],
          "separator": [
            "chevron"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "full"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Link-Farbe (secondary) muss 4.5:1 Kontrast haben. Current-Page (primary) ist visuell hervorgehoben via font-weight. Separatoren sind aria-hidden."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "separator-types",
      "label": "Separator-Varianten",
      "description": "Vergleich aller 5 Separator-Typen mit reduzierter Opacity",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "appearance": [
            "default"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "full"
          ],
          "content": [
            "text"
          ],
          "separator": "*"
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "separator"
      ],
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "separator"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{separator}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Separatoren haben 40% Opacity. SVG-Chevron: 3:1 Non-Text-Kontrast. Feste min-width verhindert Layout-Shift."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sizes",
      "label": "Size — SM / MD",
      "description": "SM fuer Admin/Sidebar, MD fuer Haupt-Content",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": "*",
          "appearance": [
            "default"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "full"
          ],
          "content": [
            "text"
          ],
          "separator": [
            "chevron"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "core-geometry",
        "size-sm"
      ],
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "size"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{size}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "SM hat kleinere Schrift fuer dichte UIs. Kontrast muss auch bei kleinerer Schrift eingehalten werden."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ghost-appearance",
      "label": "Ghost Appearance",
      "description": "Dezente Links wie normaler Text — erst bei Hover interaktiv. Fuer minimalistische Artikel-Seiten.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "appearance": [
            "ghost"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "full"
          ],
          "content": [
            "text"
          ],
          "separator": [
            "chevron"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default",
          "hover"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "variant-ghost"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "{state}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Ghost-Links muessen auch in text-tertiary Farbe 4.5:1 Kontrast einhalten. Hover zeigt Underline fuer Interaktivitaet."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "home-icon",
      "label": "Home Icon",
      "description": "Haus-SVG statt 'Home'-Text — platzsparend und international verstaendlich",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "appearance": [
            "default"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "full"
          ],
          "content": [
            "home-icon"
          ],
          "separator": [
            "chevron"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "home-icon"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "label": "home-icon"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA non-text (3:1)",
        "note": "Home-Icon Link braucht aria-label='Home'. Icon muss 3:1 Non-Text-Kontrast haben."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "truncated",
      "label": "Smart Truncation",
      "description": "Home + letzte 2 Items sichtbar. Mittlere Ebenen im Ellipsis-Dropdown.",
      "composes": [
        "ellipsis"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "appearance": [
            "default"
          ],
          "variant": [
            "truncated"
          ],
          "content": [
            "text"
          ],
          "separator": [
            "chevron"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "dropdown"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "breadcrumb-truncated",
        "label": "truncated"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Ellipsis-Button: aria-label='Weitere Seiten anzeigen'. Smart-Truncation bewahrt Kontext: Home (Woher?) + letzte 2 (Wo bin ich?)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "truncated-dropdown",
      "label": "Truncation — Dropdown Open",
